# Imbuer

#G#Spreadsheet#= **Imbuer** is a spreadsheet with an Excel-style ribbon, formulas, charts and number formats. Its cells understand Keydown text styles, and sheets import and export as CSV!

[Open Imbuer](/imbuer) · [Phone version](/imbuer/mobile/)


::divider{wavy|Imbuer|teal}
## What it does

* #B.aurora(A grid) with selection, editing, copy and paste, find and replace, and sheet tabs along the bottom!
* #PR.aurora(Formulas) with autocomplete, so typing `=SU` suggests the functions that start that way!
* #PK.aurora(Charts) built from a selected range!
* #R.aurora(Conditional formatting, sorting and filtering, and templates)!
* #O.aurora(Cell formatting) for numbers, colors, borders and fonts, with Keydown in cells for chips and highlights!
* #GL.aurora(CSV) import and export from the File screen!

## Working with formulas

Start a cell with `=`. References like `A1` and ranges like `A1:B10` work as usual, and functions take arguments in parentheses. A formula bar shows what is in the selected cell!

```
=SUM(A1:A10)
=AVERAGE(B2:B20)
=IF(C2>100, "high", "low")
```

